    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. but honestly it feels like these new rules are just being pushed through without much thought for people like us. it seems like a lot of these mandates are more about meeting certain political climate goals than actually helping small businesses stay afloat. do you think these regulations are actually justified, or are they just an unnecessary burden that's going to kill small manufacturing?",
